Data file {#Sec8}
---------

Use an Excel database with saved 'Data file' link. As part of the submission, upload the file through the Manuscript Submission Portal. This is a further condition on acceptance, but part of the submitted file. The file must be accessible to the Editor only once the paper has been published, and remains so only for a reasonable period afterwards. All the data that describe how the authors obtained their data (vide infra) must be included in this file.

Supply, select, and edit items {#sec3.6}
------------------------------

The following figure represents a revised version of the acronym FAIR. Provide each item with a brief description.

A comprehensive guide to the indexing of item sentences {#sec3.7}
--------------------------------------------------------

In the instructions for the test, students are provided with a table for each item and a guide to making their answers more understandable. Although it is not essential to write an essay to answer the questions, you will find this section of the report particularly useful.
